  _lines:
  - Of course not.
  - Unfortunately... There is no end to this.
  - 'There is no lawsuit, weapon, or power- from you alone- that could end me. I
    am a roach: kill one, a replacement will spawn. That is the nature of the Company.'
  - Do not bargain- you will only waste your breath.
  - I give you two options.
